      "title": "FSSCat: The Federated Satellite Systems 3Cat Mission: Demonstrating the capabilities of CubeSats to monitor essential climate variables of the water cycle [Instruments and Missions]",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Camps A."
        },
        {
          "name": "Munoz-Martin J.F."
        },
        {
          "name": "Ruiz-De-Azua J.A."
